Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.74,0:19:38.99,OTHERS,,0,0,0,,{\fs26\frz14\c&H888888&\pos(1081,829)}市川好像在找什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.74,0:19:38.99,OTHERS,,0,0,0,,{\fs26\frz15\c&H888888&\pos(800,889)}咦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.74,0:19:38.99,OTHERS,,0,0,0,,{\fs26\frz15\c&H888888&\pos(842,1026)}謝謝
